1. **Backlog of goals** — a good intake SEALS, a forged one REMANDS, in one shared runner (tested).
2. **Runs write scars** — after a remand, the shared store holds a new scar (tested).
3. **Self-improvement** — a scar in the store is injected into a later goal whose signature matches, on
